      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we peek the size from any SkUniformDataBlock that `uniformData` points to, we can get the UniformWriter from the buffer manager before we iterate over the entries in `uniformData`. While the peeking will be a little awkward, I think it\u0027ll simplify the overall function since we won\u0027t have to remember all the pointers in `udbs`.",
