        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-03T20:30:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would it make sense to define a local type that combines the pipelineToSsboIndices and corresponding uniform bindings, and makes friendlier functions than having to work through a series of integer key queries?",
